## 5. Review Verdict

The D3 fuzzing implementation is well-structured, specification-derived, deterministic, and independently oracled. The author correctly reported all target defects and coverage gaps in `docs/logs/d3-findings.log` without modifying out-of-scope targets.

VERDICT: PASS
